{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00317","headline":"游後湖赏莲花 · 嗣主璟","name":"游後湖赏莲花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓼花蘸水火不灭，水鸟惊鱼银梭投。\n满目荷花千万顷，红碧相杂敷清流。\n孙武已斩吴宫女，琉璃池上佳人头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"嗣主璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}